---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const BEEHIIV_PARTNER_URL = 'https://www.beehiiv.com?via=QUICKSTART';
const INTAKE_FORM_URL = 'https://airtable.com/appIZWByRN8VbJ0u0/pagf3NCtNNVSyENgE/form';
const COREY_EMAIL = 'ckmedia@fastmail.com';
---

<Layout
  title="Your Next Steps | Redefining Retirement"
  description="Complete these three steps to get your Done-For-You MVP Newsletter Setup started."
  type="website"
  noindex={true}
  bare={true}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container ob-container">

      <p class="ob-eyebrow">Purchase Confirmed</p>
      <h1 class="ob-headline">Congratulations — Your Newsletter Setup Has Started.</h1>
      <p class="ob-intro">You're one step closer to owning your audience. But first, I need the keys to the engine.</p>

      <div class="urgency-box">
        <strong>IMPORTANT: Your 72-Hour Guarantee Clock Starts NOW.</strong><br />
        I cannot begin work until I have access to your account and your brand assets. Complete all three steps below to get started.
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-header">
          <span class="step-number">1</span>
          <h2 class="step-title">Create Your Beehiiv Account <span class="required">(Required)</span></h2>
        </div>
        <p>You must sign up for the <strong>Scale Plan</strong>. This is non-negotiable — it's the only plan that lets me join your account as a team member without sharing your password.</p>
        <a href={BEEHIIV_PARTNER_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="step-link">Sign up for Beehiiv Scale &rarr;</a>
        <p class="note">Use code <strong>QUICKSTART</strong> at checkout for 20% off your first 3 months. (This is my partner link.)</p>
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-header">
          <span class="step-number">2</span>
          <h2 class="step-title">Grant Me "Draftsman" Access</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Once you're logged into Beehiiv:</p>
        <ol class="step-list">
          <li>Go to <strong>Settings &rarr; Team</strong></li>
          <li>Click <strong>"Invite Team Member"</strong></li>
          <li>Invite me at: <strong>{COREY_EMAIL}</strong></li>
          <li>Set my role to <strong>"Admin"</strong> or <strong>"Manager"</strong> so I have the permissions to build everything</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-header">
          <span class="step-number">3</span>
          <h2 class="step-title">Fill Out the "Newsletter Set-up" Onboarding Form</h2>
        </div>
        <p>This is where you give me your logo, links, and branding so I can customize your setup. It takes about 5 minutes.</p>
        <a href={INTAKE_FORM_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-cta">Access Your Newsletter Setup Intake Form &rarr;</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .ob-container {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .ob-eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--blue);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .ob-headline {
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.2rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .ob-intro {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .urgency-box {
    background: #fff8e1;
    border: 2px solid #f59e0b;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .step {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 2rem 0;
  }

  .step-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .step-number {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 2.25rem;
    height: 2.25rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--blue);
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .step-title {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .required {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #dc2626;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .step-list {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .step-list li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .step-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0.5rem;
    color: var(--blue);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .note {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .btn-cta {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    height: 56px;
    padding: 0 2rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
</style>
